msgid "Archived: Building ArduPilot for APM2.x on MacOS with Arduino"
msgstr "已归档：在 MacOS 上使用 Arduino 为 APM2.x 构建 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:9
#: f46a0123e2194e318459c52d9af377b1
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:11
#: abd69bd7c2be4f1ab7ca17df76baced5
msgid "ArduPilot no longer supports Arduino or AVR."
msgstr "ArduPilot 不再支持 Arduino 或 AVR。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:15
#: 3c03e18f3c704fff85bd38b1383fa430
msgid ""
"Copter 3.3 firmware (and later) no longer fits on APM boards. The last "
"firmware builds that can be installed (v3.2.1) can be downloaded from here: "
"`APM2.x "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_2.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__"
" and `APM 1.0 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_1.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"Copter 3.3 及更高版本的固件已无法安装到 APM 飞控板。最后可安装的固件版本（v3.2.1）可从以下地址下载：`APM2.x "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_2.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__"
" 和 `APM 1.0 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/firmware/ArduCopter_APM_1.0_Firmware_3.2.1.zip>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:21
#: a4d422e776e24622a564bda414e1f36f
msgid "Plane, Rover and AntennaTracker builds can still be installed."
msgstr "Plane、Rover 和 AntennaTracker 的固件仍可安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:23
#: c9287978bde7483181ff6efbf53b0353
msgid ""
"To build the ardupilot source code on MacOS for AVR targets (such as the "
"APM1 or APM2) you have two choices. The first option is to build using a "
"modified version of the Arduino build environment. You can get it from "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ under the Tools directory."
msgstr ""
"要在 MacOS 上为 AVR 目标（如 APM1 或 APM2）构建 ardupilot 源代码，有两种选择。第一种是使用修改版的 Arduino "
"构建环境进行构建，可从 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/ 的 Tools 目录下获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:28
#: 2e9deb9e9e264c23bc23eb6f7011f9a2
msgid ""
"The second choice is to build using the 'make' tool on the command line. If "
"using the Arduino tool, then after installing it, you need to do the "
"following:"
msgstr "第二种选择是在命令行使用「make」工具进行构建。如果使用 Arduino 工具，安装后需要执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:32
#: 5d0f025f5548444e9ac90fb553de92ff
msgid "Choose your board type under the ArduPilot menu"
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 菜单下选择您的飞控板类型"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:33
#: 023d9cb2af7c41ed8552b6cd3b9cb082
msgid ""
"Set your Sketchbook location under **File \\| Preferences** to point at the "
"root of your git checkout of the ardupilot sources"
msgstr ""
"在 **File \\| Preferences**（文件 \\| 首选项）下设置 Sketchbook 位置，指向您 git 克隆的 "
"ardupilot 源代码根目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-the-code-on-mac.rst:35
#: 1041ac571055417aabef7a389fc8764c
msgid "Stop and restart Arduino"
msgstr "停止并重启 Arduino"
